# WP-BUILDER-CMDLET (UE 5.5 UWorldPartitionBuilderCommandlet + UWorldPartitionHLODsBuilder): the editor without a
# window - `--run WorldPartitionBuilder --builder <Name> --scene <file>` (`--name=value` is the same flag) - runs one
# builder on the named world once its content settled and exits: 0 built, 1 refused/failed, 2 command line refused.
# Builders: HLODs, DeleteHLODs, Convert, ResaveEntities (--only-dirty, --builder-cell-size <cm>), FoliageRepartition.
#
# LEAD, BEFORE THE EDITOR STARTS (a shell step - play_scenario has no line for a second process):
#   1. Make WP_Protocol's HLODs stale: in the editor move the bench entity of the world (or re-import its mesh with
#      the new shape) and save; the WP panel then shows "N stale" (N > 0). Quit the editor.
#   2. From Editor/:  ../bin/<cfg>/Editor/DesertEditor --project ../Projects/Desert/Desert.deproj \
#        --run=WorldPartitionBuilder --builder=HLODs --scene Content/Scenes/WP_Protocol.desce ; echo "exit=$?"
#      Expect: NO window or splash appears; exit=0; editor.log has "[WorldPartitionBuilder] HLODs on '...WP_Protocol
#      .desce': custom loading, 1 cell(s)", "[Build HLODs] 'WP_Protocol': ... read back: 0 stale cell(s)" and
#      "[WorldPartitionBuilder] HLODs: succeeded in ... s (1 cell(s))".
#   3. Refusals (each exit=2, nothing opens): `--builder HLOD` (lists the builders), `--builder HLODs` without
#      --scene, `--builder HLODs --builder-cell-size 51200` (HLODs loads its own way), `--run Foo`.
#   4. `--builder ResaveEntities --builder-cell-size 51200` -> exit=0, "cell i/n ... loaded, ... unloaded" lines.
Проект Projects/Desert/Desert.deproj --scene Content/Scenes/WP_Protocol.desce
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано run Panel "Open World Partition"
Тогда-вид cmdlet_panel панель World Partition: «0 stale» (HLOD построены коммандлетом, не кнопкой)
Когда run Mode "Select mode"
Когда run Action "Play"
Когда advance 2
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,3000,-100000
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-0.2,1
Когда advance 2
Тогда cmdlet_hlods дальние HLOD актуальны: скамейка вдали в НОВОЙ форме/месте (как после шага 1), не старая; панель WP «0 stale»
